      </div>
    </front>
    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-prov16">
        <head xml:id="gom-prov16-Hd1e98">Caput 16</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov16-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov16-Hd1e102">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov16-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov16-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov16_1@1-4">Hominis est animum praeparare.</quote>
            Quomodo ergo hominis est animum praeparare, et Dei gubernare linguam? sed persecutionis tempus significat, de quo dicitur, <quote xml:id="gom-prov16-Qd1e109" source="http://scta.info/resource/mt10_19@5-18">Nolite cogitare quomodo, aut quod loquamini: datur enim in illa hora, quid loquamini</quote>.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov16-Dd1e114">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov16-Hd1e116">Versus 2</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov16-d1e118">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov16-Qd1e120" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov16_2@1-2">Omnes viae.</quote>
            Ita actiones omnium bonorum, <pb ed="#P" n="1099A"/> scilicet, et malorum quid in occulto cogitent, certa lance discernit, unde subdit.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov16-Dd1e127">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov16-Hd1e129">Versus 3</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov16-d1e131">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov16-Qd1e133" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov16_3@1-2">Revela Domino.</quote>
            Opera nostra revelamus, quando, quem nihil latere novimus, in cunctis, quae agimus, in memoriam reducimus, atque illius flagitamus auxilium: et tunc non solum opera, sed cogitationes dirigit.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov16-Dd1e138">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov16-Hd1e140">Versus 4</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov16-d1e142">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov16-Qd1e144" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov16_4@1-3">Universa propter semetipsum,</quote>
            etc. Nulla fuit Domino causa operandi, nisi sola voluntas, ut suam scilicet, bonitatem rationabili creaturae, quam perpetuo faceret beatam, ostenderet: eum vero qui bonum conditionis propria sponte deseruit, id est diabolum, cum suis sequacibus, justa severitate damnavit.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov16-Dd1e150">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov16-Hd1e152">Versus 5</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov16-d1e154">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov16-Qd1e156" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov16_5">Abominatio est.</quote>
            <!-- check: lemma not matched to verse text -->
            Quicunque tribuit sibi <pb ed="#P" n="1099B"/> bonum quod facit, etiamsi nihil videtur mali manibus operari, cordis innocentiam perdit, in quo largitori bonorum se praetulit: et ideo talem Dominus abominatur virum, quem sibi in beneficiis videt ingratum.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov16-Dd1e165">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov16-Hd1e167">Versus 7</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov16-d1e169">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov16-Qd1e171" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov16_7@1-3">Cum placuerint Domino.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov16-Qd1e174"><seg type="qs">Tanta est sanctitas divinae religionis</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">sed etiam ad veritatem fidei conversi sunt.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov16-Dd1e183">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov16-Hd1e185">Versus 8</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov16-d1e187">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov16-Qd1e189" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov16_8@1-5">Melius est parum cum justitia,</quote>
            etc. Melius est in simplici conversatione Deo servire devote, quam multis abundare virtutibus, et proximorum facta despicere.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov16-Dd1e194">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov16-Hd1e196">Versus 10</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov16-d1e198">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov16-Qd1e200" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov16_10@1-4">Divinatio in labiis regis.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov16-Qd1e203"><seg type="qs">Quis alius rex non errat in judicio</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">qui prophetarum ejus ora impleret.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov16-Dd1e212">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov16-Hd1e214">Versus 11</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov16-d1e216">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1099C"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov16-Qd1e220" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov16_11@1-3">Pondus et statera.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov16-Qd1e223"><seg type="qs">Lapides justi fortes</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">mensuram fidei et gratiarum distribuit.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov16-Dd1e232">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov16-Hd1e234">Versus 13</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov16-d1e236">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov16-Qd1e238" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov16_13@1-2">Voluntas regum,</quote>
            etc., id est, justorum. <quote xml:id="gom-prov16-Qd1e241" source="http://scta.info/resource/lc10_24@5-16">Multi reges et prophetae voluerunt videre, quae vos vidistis, et non viderunt.</quote> Hi enim et vitiis resistunt, et virtutum obsequio, quasi satellitum, constipantur. Reges enim terrae saepe labia justa detestantur, ut Herodes Joannem.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov16-Dd1e247">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov16-Hd1e249">Versus 14</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov16-d1e251">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov16-Qd1e253" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov16_14@3-4">Nuntii mortis.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov16-Qd1e256"><seg type="qs">Angeli Satanae, haeretici</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">quem contigit stulte loquendo offendisse.</seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov16-d1e264">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov16-Qd1e266" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov16_14@8-8">Placabit.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-prov16-Rd1e269"><name xml:id="gom-prov16-Nd1e270" ref="#Jerome">HIER.</name>, de morte Fabiolae.</ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov16-Qd1e274">David homicidium et adulterium septem dierum fame purgavit.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov16-Dd1e278">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov16-Hd1e280">Versus 15</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov16-d1e282">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov16-Qd1e284" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov16_15@1-5">In hilaritate vultus regis vita.</quote>
            Quicunque hilarem Christi vultum videre merentur, his <pb ed="#P" n="1099D"/> in aeternum cum illo vivere dabitur. Aliter etiam <quote xml:id="gom-prov16-Qd1e289" source="http://scta.info/resource/lc3_6@2-6">videbit omnis caro salutare Dei:</quote> sed tunc justi placatum, reprobi videbunt iratum.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov16-d1e293">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov16-Qd1e295" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov16_15@6-11">Et clementia ejus quasi imber serotinus.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov16-Qd1e298"><seg type="qs">Serotinus imber in Judaea usque hodie jam maturis messibus venire consuevit</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">sed superni facit irrigatio Domini.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov16-Dd1e307">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov16-Hd1e309">Versus 22</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov16-d1e311">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov16-Qd1e313" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov16_22@1-2">Fons vitae.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov16-Qd1e316"><seg type="qs">Quia ille praedicator vere suis auditoribus vias vitae aperit</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">quae dicunt bona, fatuo corde contemnunt.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov16-Dd1e325">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov16-Hd1e327">Versus 24</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov16-d1e329">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov16-Qd1e331" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov16_24@1-4">Favus mellis composita verba,</quote>
            etc. <quote xml:id="gom-prov16-Qd1e334"><seg type="qs">Multi per eloquentiam</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">quae ex interna animae dulcedine procedunt.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov16-Dd1e343">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov16-Hd1e345">Versus 26</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov16-d1e347">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov16-Qd1e349" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov16_26@1-4">Anima laborantis laborat sibi,</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov16-Qd1e352"><seg type="qs">etc. <pb ed="#P" n="1100A"/> Constat ad litteram</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">quia necesse habet facere bona, quae dicit.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov16-Dd1e363">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov16-Hd1e365">Versus 27</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov16-d1e367">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov16-Qd1e369" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov16_27@1-4">Vir insipiens fodit malum.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov16-Qd1e372"><seg type="qs">Potest hoc de haeretico specialiter intelligi</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">unde Jacobus: <quote xml:id="gom-prov16-Qd1e378" source="http://scta.info/resource/iac3_6@17-23">Lingua inflammat rotam nativitatis nostrae inflammata a gehenna</quote>.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov16-Dd1e385">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov16-Hd1e387">Versus 29</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov16-d1e389">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov16-Qd1e391" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov16_29@1-5">Vir iniquus lactat amicum suum,</quote>
            etc. Potest hoc de haeretico et de omni fautore malorum accipi: <quote xml:id="gom-prov16-Qd1e394" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps9_24@1-10">quoniam laudatur peccator in desideriis animae suae, et iniquus benedicitur.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov16-Dd1e399">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov16-Hd1e401">Versus 30</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov16-d1e403">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov16-Qd1e405" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov16_30@1-4">Qui attonitis oculis cogitat,</quote>
            etc. <quote xml:id="gom-prov16-Qd1e408"><seg type="qs">Gravius est perficere malum quam facere</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">ut quae malorum suorum retributio sequatur, non videat.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov16-Dd1e417">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov16-Hd1e419">Versus 32</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov16-d1e421">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov16-Qd1e423" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov16_32@1-5">Melior est patiens viro forti,</quote>
            etc. <quote xml:id="gom-prov16-Qd1e426"><seg type="qs">Minor <pb ed="#P" n="1100B"/> est victoria urbes expugnare</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">et patientiae humilitate substernit.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov16-Dd1e437">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov16-Hd1e439">Versus 33</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov16-d1e441">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov16-Qd1e443" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov16_33@1-4">Sortes mittuntur in sinum.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov16-Qd1e446"><seg type="qs">Sicut sortes mittuntur in sinum</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">quasi de sinu examinis divini.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
